{"id":"n24799-1-7","stage":2,"title":"장난 · 闹着玩","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24799-1-7-1","ko":"저기 놀이터에서 장난을 치고 있는 아이가 우리 둘째야.","zh":"那边在游乐场闹着玩的那个孩子，就是我们的第二个孩子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"놀이터에서","meaning":"游乐场","explanation":"놀이터：游乐场；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"놀이터","audio":"/audio/cac9ffa4c39d8c15ba9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40768","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀이터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀이터에서","audio":"/audio/b9756e30cee8228baf55.mp3"}},{"text":"장난을","meaning":"闹着玩，开玩笑","explanation":"장난：闹着玩，开玩笑；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장난","audio":"/audio/4ecff0aab1862eb976b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24799","senseId":"1","lemma":"장난","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장난을","audio":"/audio/70627fffd3aa7796b5d3.mp3"}},{"text":"치고","meaning":"搞，干","explanation":"치다：搞，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"22","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치고","audio":"/audio/3611b3d4aa1fc542d891.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我，我们","explanation":"우리：我，我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"3","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"둘째야.","meaning":"老二","explanation":"둘째：老二；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"둘째","audio":"/audio/d32fb19bd64f81d079e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90911","senseId":"2","lemma":"둘째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘째야","audio":"/audio/34fca7c4b6a4bb6b9eb0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"cac9ffa4c39d8c15","term":"놀이터","zh":"游乐场","audio":"/audio/cac9ffa4c39d8c15ba9f.mp3","entryId":"40768","definition":"设有滑梯或秋千等器具、供孩子们玩乐的地方。","pronunciation":["노리터"]},{"id":"4ecff0aab1862eb9","term":"장난","zh":"闹着玩，开玩笑","audio":"/audio/4ecff0aab1862eb976b8.mp3","entryId":"24799","definition":"孩子们为了好玩或消遣而而做的事情。","pronunciation":["장난"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"搞，干","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"欺骗或折磨别人，或指做不好的举动。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我，我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"d32fb19bd64f81d0","term":"둘째","zh":"老二","audio":"/audio/d32fb19bd64f81d079e1.mp3","entryId":"90911","definition":"第二个孩子。","pronunciation":["둘ː째"]}],"audio":"/audio/6abb106079def91b64ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24799-1-7-2","ko":"너랑 정말 많이 닮았구나.","zh":"你和他长得真像呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너랑","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너랑","audio":"/audio/32c7250ffa53acbc7ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"닮았구나.","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닮았구나","audio":"/audio/d0291906b03c93808dc1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"593cd68a24885987","term":"닮다","zh":"像，随","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3","entryId":"73354","definition":"指两个以上的人或事物拥有相似的长相或属性。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/09ef75c2538a0fa1388d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.457,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24799","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":76,"sequenceScore":2.1104,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那边在游乐场闹着玩的那个孩子，就是我们的第二个孩子啊。","你和他长得真像呢。","我进来的时候，看到有个车停在停车场里。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那边在游乐场闹着玩的那个孩子，就是我们的第二个孩子啊。","你和他长得真像呢。","我进来的时候，看到有个车停在停车场里。"],"answer":1}]}
